There are no notes that mention what's new in the update, but Apple does have a <a href="https://support.apple.com/en-us/127196">HomeView software support document</a> that should have details in the near future. The 27.2.1 updates for other platforms were primarily focused on security, but the HomeView Software 27.2.1 does not include any published CVE entries. <br/>
